{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear International Players,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Gookoo Games, the solo developer of this indie football title. As this is a one-person project, please kindly wait for localized versions. I promise to prioritize multilingual support as development progresses. Thank you for your interest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Foreword</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other Chinese football games filled with self-deprecating jokes, repetitive memes, or excessive focus on negative stereotypes, this game carries a different vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I believe in Chinese football's brighter future. We're no football desert. Even if we're not at our best today, we deserve dreams - to find our path forward with courage and determination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chinese Football Simulator</i> delivers an authentic local football management experience with Chinese characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond standard 3D match simulations, team management, and youth academy development, you'll:<br>\u2022 Tour across China's football landscape<br>\u2022 Forge mutually beneficial relationships<br>\u2022 Scout hidden gems from grassroots/amateur circuits<br>\u2022 Customize every aspect through MOD Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May you thrive in China's vibrant football world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome, Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 As both club owner and manager, choose your background and operate your team freely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize: Tactics \u2022 Kits \u2022 Badges \u2022 Stadiums \u2022 Facilities \u2022 Stand decorations \u2022 and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6013e4e855ca8620c8754c52a91c4fa5.poster.avif?t=1767511174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6013e4e855ca8620c8754c52a91c4fa5.webm?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6013e4e855ca8620c8754c52a91c4fa5.mp4?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Football Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit major cities, establish affiliate clubs, and build your network through reciprocal relationships with NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/8bbb9a8255de41bc5acb8caf3ac1f6a0.poster.avif?t=1767511174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/8bbb9a8255de41bc5acb8caf3ac1f6a0.webm?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While still improving, we're committed to delivering 3D match simulations with tactical camera perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/cbf8367d6ae53c365b723a055e075423.poster.avif?t=1767511174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/cbf8367d6ae53c365b723a055e075423.webm?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/cbf8367d6ae53c365b723a055e075423.mp4?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your prestige through:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Social connections (&quot;face&quot; culture)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Strategic promises during transfer negotiations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/a6cc9f7f2cdc52eba3088b4ac3e87ae3.poster.avif?t=1767511174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/a6cc9f7f2cdc52eba3088b4ac3e87ae3.webm?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Historical Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover China's football origins through journalists' stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/157212eb454d49322879967c2ac179f3.poster.avif?t=1767511174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/157212eb454d49322879967c2ac179f3.webm?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOD Workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize all game elements via community mods:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rosters \u2022 Player models \u2022 Dynamic backgrounds \u2022 and beyond</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6fbe06e8ef6599528b83f6f1f3e9c18d.poster.avif?t=1767511174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6fbe06e8ef6599528b83f6f1f3e9c18d.webm?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6fbe06e8ef6599528b83f6f1f3e9c18d.mp4?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304320?t=1767511174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304320?t=1767511174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/0bcbcf9f414635096b0ed1c8065d0211b5904060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767511174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/0bcbcf9f414635096b0ed1c8065d0211b5904060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767511174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3425340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear International Players,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Gookoo Games, the solo developer of this indie football title. As this is a one-person project, please kindly wait for localized versions. I promise to prioritize multilingual support as development progresses. Thank you for your interest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Foreword</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other Chinese football games filled with self-deprecating jokes, repetitive memes, or excessive focus on negative stereotypes, this game carries a different vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I believe in Chinese football's brighter future. We're no football desert. Even if we're not at our best today, we deserve dreams - to find our path forward with courage and determination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chinese Football Simulator</i> delivers an authentic local football management experience with Chinese characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond standard 3D match simulations, team management, and youth academy development, you'll:<br>\u2022 Tour across China's football landscape<br>\u2022 Forge mutually beneficial relationships<br>\u2022 Scout hidden gems from grassroots/amateur circuits<br>\u2022 Customize every aspect through MOD Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May you thrive in China's vibrant football world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome, Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 As both club owner and manager, choose your background and operate your team freely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize: Tactics \u2022 Kits \u2022 Badges \u2022 Stadiums \u2022 Facilities \u2022 Stand decorations \u2022 and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6013e4e855ca8620c8754c52a91c4fa5.poster.avif?t=1767511174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6013e4e855ca8620c8754c52a91c4fa5.webm?t=1767511174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33